    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96112" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπύρᾰθ-ος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ],
		ὁ</span> or ἡ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυράς</span>, only in pl., <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
			32
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			34
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Dsc.
			2.80
		</span></i>; so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυρά̆θ-ιον</span></b> , τό, prob. cj. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπυρίθιον</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Id.
			<u>Ther.</u>
			19
		</span></i> (pl.); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφυραθία</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Poll.
			5.91
		</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπύρδαρα</span></b>  ibid.
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δανα</span>
			).</div>
